[[0,1710806,0,2,0,2,"2017-03-11T00:54:42","MammyDindu","",[],"<p>Hell I would even accept not-super-cucked conservative organizations. I live in a leftist hell hole and am so alienated from everyone around me. I need to start real-life networking with like-minded people. I'm surrounded by fucking idiots all day, every day. I can't take it anymore.</p>","Are there any other alt-right organizations besides Identity Evropa that have meetups?","","Identitarian"],[1,8372211,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-11T01:14:21","vox-alba","",[],"<p>If you have a university in your town (that isn't completely cucked) they might have some kind of organization.</p>"],[1,8372806,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-11T02:18:33","kolarov133","",[],"<p>Check this: <a href=\"http://bbs.dailystormer.com/c/book-club\">http://bbs.dailystormer.com/c/book-club</a></p>"],[1,8373102,0,2,0,2,"2017-03-11T02:57:18","Kick_Start","",[],"<p>Identity Evropa is definitely the best one.</p>"],[1,8374541,0,2,0,2,"2017-03-11T06:32:21","Evola1","",[],"<p>By the way, how does one avoid FBI honeypots and other government agency plots to entrap young huwhite people.</p>\n<p>Obviously people saying &quot;Let's go do X act of terrorism&quot; are probably Feds trying to entrap you. But are there any other red flags that the org you're joining is a trap and/or controlled opposition? </p>"],[2,8376096,8374541,1,0,1,"2017-03-11T12:58:52","RUSTYMILL","",[],"<p>If they are a right wing organization that loves Israel but hates multiculturalism, feminism and arabs, they might be controlled opposition. Aka (((Rebel media)))</p>"],[3,8380905,8376096,0,0,0,"2017-03-11T23:19:13","Evola1","",[],"<p>Makes sense. Rebel Media is not a hard organization to figure out though. I mean Ezra Levant is pretty darn open about his Jewishness and also his support for Israel and hating any antisemitic sentiment. For anyone who knows even the slightest thing about Jews it should be pretty obvious why Rebel Media shies away from ethnonationalism.</p>"]]
